5,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"Since it's the first day and we have no information, I think it's best to observe everyone's behavior for now. Does anyone have any initial thoughts?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with Toshio. Since we have no clues yet, we should just listen to how everyone speaks and see if any contradictions arise.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Let's keep the conversation open. I'm curious to see who will be the most hesitant to speak or who tries too hard to lead the discussion.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minato,,"I'll do my best to help! I'm a bit nervous, but I want to find the werewolf so we can all be safe.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I believe a patient approach is wise. Let us all speak honestly and observe the flow of the conversation. I am looking forward to seeing how we work together.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"It seems we are all in agreement on the approach. @Minato, you mentioned being nervous; is there anything specifically that's on your mind, or are you just feeling the pressure of the game?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"I think Minato is just being honest about his feelings. It's a tense situation for everyone, regardless of their role.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Misaki. Minato's honesty is refreshing, though in this game, innocence can be a mask. Let's see if that openness continues as the pressure increases.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minato,,"I just don't want to make a mistake and accidentally help the werewolf. I'll try my best to be honest, like Mizuki-san said!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is heartening to see such sincerity. However, we must remember that the werewolf's goal is to blend in. Let us remain mindful of both the words spoken and the silence between them.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"That is a fair point, Jonathan. Since we are all being quite agreeable so far, perhaps we should consider what patterns we should look for tomorrow once the first night's events are revealed.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,We should look for anyone who seems too eager to deflect suspicion or anyone who suddenly changes their tone after the first night's results are announced.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,Exactly. We should also pay attention to who tries to steer the vote too aggressively. A werewolf might try to create a scapegoat early to secure their position.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minato,,"That makes sense! I'll try to pay attention to that. I hope we can all trust each other, but I'll be careful.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Trust is a fragile thing in this game, Minato. While we hope for the best, we must rely on logic and observation to ensure our safety.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Toshio,,"Since we've established our general strategy, I'll spend the rest of today observing. Let's see what the first night brings us. I'm ready to move forward.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll do the same. I'm looking forward to seeing how the dynamics shift tomorrow.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I'll be watching closely as well. Let's see who among us is hiding their true nature.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Minato,,I'll do my best to remember everything we talked about! Good luck to everyone tonight.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Minato,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I shall also reflect on our words tonight. May the truth reveal itself in the morning.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
